      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-07-19T17:18:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m convinced this is a better direction. I wrote my rationale on https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id\u003d985540.",
